I created a simple website following the guidance for the assignment. It has a button and a header. If you open the JavaScript it has some lists of favorites in there. 
AI created something pretty straightforward and honestly pretty easy to understand. It was interesting to see how it filled in the favorites with its base of knowledge. For example the top artists were David Bowie, Beyonce, and Kendrick Lamar.
It would feel pretty limiting to only rely on AI or someone else to complete your work. It would feel as though you couldn't expand, learn, or grow. 
If you asked the AI to accompany its work with in depth explanations of what it completed, and then you took the time to read and learn what it did, then maybe you could adequately explain the code that was written. Otherwise, if you just copy and pasted with no chance to understand, you would most likely not be able to explain the code.
The final work still feels like my own as I wrote most of it, and understand it pretty well.  
